      },
      "message": "feat(post): the Klartext post writes smoothing as cycle 32 TOLERANCE\n\nThe Heidenhain Klartext post writes a section's smoothing ask as\nCYCL DEF 32.0 TOLERANCE / 32.1 T, and 32.2 HSC-MODE where the\nresolver flag g62Mode permits it (option 2 on the iTNC 530 340 49x).\nThe T range comes from g62TMaxUm. The section end resets the cycle.\nBefore, the post refused each smoothing ask.\n\nRefs #4095\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
